## Key Types and Structs

### `config.AppConfig` (`pkg/virt-v2v/config/variables.go`)

Central configuration loaded from environment variables and CLI flags.

```go
type AppConfig struct {
    LibvirtUrl                   string
    Fingerprint                  string
    IsInPlace                    bool
    ExtraArgs                    []string
    InspectorExtraArgs           []string
    IsLocalMigration             bool
    NewVmName                    string
    VmName                       string
    RootDisk                     string
    StaticIPs                    string
    Source                       string   // "ova", "vSphere", "hyperv", "ec2"
    DiskPath                     string
    SecretKey                    string
    AccessKeyId                  string
    VirtIoWinLegacyDrivers       string
    HostName                     string
    IsRemoteInspection           bool
    RemoteInspectionDisks        []string
    MemSize                      int
    Smp                          int
    VsphereVmwareDriverRemoval   bool
    WindowsRegistryNetworkConfig bool
    WaitForGuestReboot           bool
    SelinuxRelabelAtBoot         bool
    SelinuxRelabelExclude        []string
    XfsCompatibility             bool
    SupportsNoFstrim             bool   // auto-detected from /etc/os-release (RHEL only)
    OverlayEnabled               bool   // default true
    MultipleIpsPerNicName        string
    NbdeClevis                   bool
