    // ... path constants (VddkLibDir, Luksdir, NfcPluginPath, etc.)
}
```

### `conversion.Conversion` (`pkg/virt-v2v/conversion/conversion.go`)

Wraps `AppConfig` with discovered disks and command builders. Key methods: `RunVirtV2v`, `RunVirtV2vInPlace`, `RunVirtV2vInPlaceDisk`, `RunVirtV2VInspection`, `RunRemoteV2vInspection`, `RunCustomize`, `RunInPlaceWithOverlay`, `GetDomainXML`.

### `conversion.Disk` (`pkg/virt-v2v/conversion/disk.go`)

```go
type Disk struct {
    Path       string   // mounted disk path
    Link       string   // symlink in workdir (e.g. myvm-sda)
    IsBlockDev bool
}
```

Disks are discovered from `/mnt/disks/disk[0-9]*/disk.img` (filesystem) or `/dev/block[0-9]*` (block devices). Block devices are polled with exponential backoff (up to 10 attempts) before use.

### `conversion.Overlay` (`pkg/virt-v2v/conversion/overlay.go`)

```go
type Overlay struct {
    Path         string   // qcow2 overlay file
    BackingPath  string   // original backing disk
    Disk         *Disk
    OriginalLink string
}
```

Used for in-place conversions: creates qcow2 overlays, rewires symlinks, runs conversion against overlays, then commits or discards.

### `server.Warning` (`pkg/virt-v2v/server/server.go`)

```go
type Warning struct {
    Reason  string `json:"reason"`  // e.g. "CustomizationFailed"
    Message string `json:"message"`
}
```

### `utils.InspectionV2V` / `utils.InspectionOS` (`pkg/virt-v2v/utils/xml-reader.go`)

```go
type InspectionV2V struct {
