## Conversion Modes

| Mode | Function | Input | Providers |
|------|----------|-------|-----------|
| Cold | `RunVirtV2v` | `-o kubevirt` | vSphere, OVA, Hyper-V |
| In-place libvirt | `RunVirtV2vInPlace` | `-i libvirtxml` | vSphere (warm/live) |
| In-place disk | `RunVirtV2vInPlaceDisk` | `-i disk` | EC2, providers without libvirt |
| Local inspection | `RunVirtV2VInspection` | `-i disk` on converted disks | All (post-conversion) |
| Remote inspection | `RunRemoteV2vInspection` | vSphere remote disks | vSphere only |

Cold migration pipes virt-v2v stdout through `virt-v2v-monitor` for Prometheus progress metrics.

