## HTTP Server (`pkg/virt-v2v/server/server.go`)

Exposed on **`:8080`** for local migrations only. The plan controller polls these during the `CreateVM` phase, then calls `/shutdown`.

| Endpoint | Method | Response | Purpose |
|----------|--------|----------|---------|
| `/vm` | GET | `text/yaml` (200) or 204 (in-place) | KubeVirt VM YAML from virt-v2v |
| `/inspection` | GET | `application/xml` (200) | Inspection XML |
| `/warnings` | GET | `application/json` (200) or 204 | Non-fatal warnings |
| `/shutdown` | POST/GET | 204 | Gracefully shut down the pod |

In-place conversions return 204 on `/vm` because `virt-v2v-in-place` does not generate YAML output.

