## Error Patterns

| Scenario | Behavior |
|----------|----------|
| Conversion failure | Pod exits with code 1; migration VM phase fails |
| Customization failure | Non-fatal; `CustomizationFailed` warning exposed via `/warnings` |
| Overlay commit failure | Partial commit possible; error message lists committed disks |
| Block device not ready | Retries up to 10 times with exponential backoff (ENXIO, ENOENT, EIO) |
| Remote inspection with no disks | Fatal: `no remote disks were supplied` |
| Legacy VirtIO ISO missing | Unsets `VIRTIO_WIN` env var, continues without legacy drivers |

